{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"14418","name":"Side Star Resort","description":"يقدم فندق Side Star Resort لضيوفه تجربة متوسطية لا تُنسى مع كرم الضيافة الدافئ والخدمة الاستثنائية. يقع الفندق بالقرب من شبه جزيرة Side التاريخية وعلى بُعد 12 كم فقط من Manavgat، وهو فندق 5 نجوم على شاطئ البحر يضم 462 غرفة وشاطئًا رمليًا حاصل على شهادة العلم الأزرق. استمتع بمرافق شاملة على مدار العام، مع مجموعة متنوعة من أنواع الغرف، بما في ذلك الأجنحة والغرف العائلية والغرف القياسية، وقد صُممت جميعها مع مراعاة راحة الضيوف، وتوفر إطلالات خلابة.","address":"Sancak Mh. Fesleğenli Sk., 11/A","city":"SIDE","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07550","lat":36.821183,"lng":31.284324,"stars":5,"chain":"SIDES","giataCode":"29637","phone":"+902427638501","email":"resort@sidestarhotels.com","website":"www.sidestarhotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_ro_007.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.EY","category":"room","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_ro_012.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.EY-1","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_ro_006.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.LV","category":"room","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_ro_008.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.LV-1","category":"room","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/014418/014418a_hb_ro_011